post_install() {
    update-desktop-database -q /usr/share/applications 2>/dev/null || true
    gtk-update-icon-cache -q -t /usr/share/icons/hicolor 2>/dev/null || true
    cat <<'MSG'
sayTypist installed.

Start it from your application menu (Utility → sayTypist) or run: saytypist

For typing into other applications:
  X11                  -> xdotool
  Wayland (wlroots)    -> wtype
  GNOME/KDE Wayland    -> ydotoold (sudo ydotoold &) and the "ydotool" method
                          or choose the "copy" method and press Ctrl+V
MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
    post_install
}

post_remove() {
    update-desktop-database -q /usr/share/applications 2>/dev/null || true
}
